WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:09,110
Qingsi, you always tell your mother, how did you meet Zhang Tong?

2
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:13,110
It was my shameless approach, but the result was infinitely better.

3
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:17,110
Our family’s greatest wealth is the 0.5% stake in the hotel.

4
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:21,110
Zhao Qian has been forcing partners to transfer in the past few years without even paying a penny in dividends.

5
00:00:21,110 --> 00:00:23,110
Life is so tight, right?

6
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:27,110
Before you were doing live broadcasts, your mother would catch you every day, and you would move out because of the poison.

7
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:30,110
Now you suddenly become the chief auctioneer for the big boss

8
00:00:30,110 --> 00:00:32,110
There's really nothing shameful going on here, right?

9
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:35,110
Mom, it really doesn’t happen. My new enemy arranges sales positions and performance settlements.

10
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:38,110
Other employees also have clear performance and image position allowances

11
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:40,110
All standards are written into the contract

12
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:43,110
3 million annual salary, job-matched car, and compliant reimbursement

13
00:00:43,110 --> 00:00:46,110
The treatment this company gives to its employees is really rare.

14
00:00:46,110 --> 00:00:50,040
We all call him boss in private, no matter how good the company’s benefits are
